  "label": "Online meme culture and its role in amplifying hate speech",
  "description": "The meme is part of a broader online culture where memes are often used to spread hate speech, ridicule, or dismiss criticism. This culture often relies on stereotypes and can be harmful, especially when targeting marginalized groups like the LGBTQ+ community. Understanding the context of online meme culture is necessary to interpret the meme's intent and impact.",
